`std.sn`@~
G : 0x9500000
T : 0x9200000
w : ms ? (T + 4) # ms
dir : n d ? (G + 0x100 + (4 * n)) # d
put : n v ? seq2 ((G + (4 * n)) # v) (w 5)
get : n ? @(G + (4 * n))
r : a b ? a * 10 + b
q : a b c d ? (a * 1000) + (b * 100) + (c * 10) + d
`27 を出力、17 を入力(ジャンパで 17-27 をつなぐ)。期待 1010
s : v ? seq2 (put 27 v) (get 17)
q (seq3 (dir 17 0) (dir 27 1) (s 1)) (s 0) (s 1) (s 0)
